WEBVTT

00:05:29.389 --> 00:05:33.698
And this is actually how a cancer
goes from being harmless,

00:05:33.722 --> 00:05:34.889
to being deadly.

00:05:35.658 --> 00:05:36.976
Cancer cells mutate,

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.287
and they gain the ability to release
lots of those angiogenic factors,

00:05:40.311 --> 00:05:41.482
natural fertilizer,

00:05:41.506 --> 00:05:44.952
that tip the balance in favor
of blood vessels invading the cancer.

00:05:44.976 --> 00:05:46.976
And once those vessels invade the cancer,

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.976
it can expand,
it can invade local tissues,

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.301
and the same vessels
that are feeding tumors

00:05:52.325 --> 00:05:56.539
allow cancer cells to exit
into the circulation as metastases.

00:05:57.428 --> 00:06:00.182
And unfortunately,
this late stage of cancer